WEBVTT

00:01:59.597 --> 00:02:02.530
First, a few folks, and then more,

00:02:02.563 --> 00:02:03.697
and then more.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.663
Thank-you emails poured into my inbox.

00:02:07.097 --> 00:02:08.297
I wasn't a professor yet,

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.030
I hadn't even finished my PhD,

00:02:11.063 --> 00:02:13.863
but I was helping students
all over the world

00:02:13.863 --> 00:02:16.097
get through their chemistry classes.

00:02:17.063 --> 00:02:20.897
I got the sense that something big
was brewing here.

00:02:22.497 --> 00:02:24.697
But my dad would hear none of it.

00:02:25.797 --> 00:02:27.030
When I explained

00:02:27.030 --> 00:02:30.797
that I was thinking about abandoning
the traditional professorship route